<title>USA: Atmel said ITC probing into complaint.</title>
<headline>Atmel said ITC probing into complaint.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Atmel Corp said the International Trade Commission (ITC) agreed to investigate a complaint it filed with the ITC regarding the activities of Sanyo Electric Co Ltd, Winbond Electronics Corporation (Taiwan), and Macronix International Co Ltd (Taiwan).</p>
<p>The complaint alleges Sanyo, Winbond, and Macronix are unfairly competing in the U.S. marketplace for semiconductors by selling products which infringe some or all of four U.S. patents which Atmel owns or is licensed to use.</p>
</text>
